    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use the [`add(anchor:)`](arsession/add(anchor:).md) method to begin tracking your custom anchor in an AR session.",
      "ko": "`add(anchor:)` 메서드를 사용해 AR 세션에서 사용자 지정 앵커 추적을 시작합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "13b213fd835942d521eab2bac54f9665a687d037e2090d0bb40b17138d3d30e7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "After you add an environment probe anchor to the scene, ARKit begins generating environment textures for it.",
      "ko": "장면에 환경 프로브 앵커를 추가하면 ARKit가 해당 앵커의 환경 텍스처 생성을 시작합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ef8f51744482c45043ab688c031a4950455b687d093549214743fb010420177b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "To be notified when the anchor has a new [`environmentTexture`](arenvironmentprobeanchor/environmenttexture.md), implement the [`session(_:didUpdate:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didupdate:)-3qtt8.md), [`renderer(_:didUpdate:for:)`](arscnviewdelegate/renderer(_:didupdate:for:).md), or [`view(_:didUpdate:for:)`](arskviewdelegate/view(_:didupdate:for:).md) delegate method.",
      "ko": "앵커에 새 [`environmentTexture`](arenvironmentprobeanchor/environmenttexture.md)가 있는 경우 알림을 받으려면 [`session(_:didUpdate:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didupdate:)-3qtt8.md), [`renderer(_:didUpdate:for:)`](arscnviewdelegate/renderer(_:didupdate:for:).md), [`view(_:didUpdate:for:)`](arskviewdelegate/view(_:didupdate:for:).md) 중 하나의 델리게이트 메서드를 구현해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1691def3e39b59b9c1ea510ec4b9ac01b851fbdba1e3ffe0b71c6aee10b497c5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0009:0001",
      "source": "Parameters",
      "ko": "Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0010:0001",
      "source": "`transform`: A matrix that encodes the position, orientation, and scale of the anchor, relative to the world coordinate space of the AR session in which you place the anchor.",
      "ko": "`transform`: 앵커의 위치, 방향, 스케일을 인코딩하는 행렬로, 앵커를 배치한 AR 세션의 월드 좌표계에 상대적으로 지정됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ffbb1b0f40cdabb261386baa4f092bef3102a5427d4e80c95c61bcd41f4c10a2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0010:0002",
      "source": "`extent`: The extent (of *bounds*) of the probe anchor. World coordinate space in ARKit always follows a right-handed convention, but is oriented based on the session configuration. For details, see [`Understanding World Tracking`](understanding-world-tracking.md).",
      "ko": "`extent`: 프로브 앵커의 범위(*bounds*)입니다. ARKit의 세계 좌표계는 항상 오른손 좌표 규칙을 따르지만 세션 구성에 따라 방향이 결정됩니다. 자세한 내용은 [`Understanding World Tracking`](understanding-world-tracking.md)을(를) 참고합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "14d90bdaf2bc3bb018b7928a1f8d5f36c96ff504122adf6de5500ec2413e2bbd",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
